DTSTAMP:20260830T150957Z
UID:a03130ba6c33e20722729817ce46@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:In collaboration with Southport-based photographer Loryne Atou
 i\, the Fairfield Museum invites visitors to explore a free\, outdoor exhi
 bition on the Museum Commons featuring photographic portraits of 16 commun
 ity members. The exhibition showcases today’s multi-faceted Fairfield co
 mmunity and celebrates the different people who call Fairfield home. Large
 -scale photographs will be displayed on the exterior of the Fairfield Muse
 um building and other historic properties.\n\nSource: https://ctvisit.com/
 events/portraits-fairfield-exhibition
LOCATION:Fairfield Museum & History Center\, 370 Beach Rd\, Fairfield\, CT
 \, 06824\, Fairfield CT\, 06824
